---
import NewSection from "./NewSection.astro";
---

<section class="padding_sec" id="about">
  <NewSection text="About" color="black" side="left" />
  <div class="about_info">
    <h2>Hello! My name is Gabrielle</h2>
    <p>
      I am currently studying Multimedia Design at Erhvervsakademi København, specializing in <b>Front-End Development</b>. I enjoy combining creativity and code to build responsive and user-friendly digital experiences using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

      <br /><br />

      Alongside my studies, I have a background in sewing and running my own tailoring service. This has strengthened my attention to detail, structure, and aesthetics-skills I bring into my work as a front-end developer, along with a thoughtful and sustainable approach to design.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about_info {
    padding: var(--space-m) 0 var(--space-m) var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 65ch;

    p {
      padding-top: var(--space-xs);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about_info {
      padding: var(--space-m) var(--space-xs) var(--space-m) var(--space-xs);
      max-width: 65ch;
    }
  }
</style>
